# Proving-ground data stays local: 580 MB, CC BY 4.0, re-extract from the organiser zip (see data/README.md)
data/proving-ground/
data/proving-ground
# Answer keys for the attacks: never committed, never zipped (organiser rule for rowmaps; our caution for the rest)
**/rowmap_*.csv
**/truth/
**/holdout/
# Bulky outputs are regenerated; scorecard JSON and HTML under results/ are committed as evidence
out/
results/**/*.csv
# Detector labels read by the wiring ticket and the submission
!results/detect/health_labels.csv
!results/detect/unseen_field_labels.csv
results/**/*.parquet
# Per-order repair-search scorecards: bulky, cited nowhere, and their ':' names break Windows checkouts
results/*/search/
